<title>GERMANY: BHF-Bank H1 pretax profit up 10.4 pct.</title>
<headline>BHF-Bank H1 pretax profit up 10.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group pretax profit			 181    up 10.4 pct</p>
<p>    Group oper profit after provisions    162    up 9.5 pct</p>
<p>    Group risk provisions		     90     up 5.9 pct</p>
<p>    Group own-account trade profit	  57     down 5.0 pct</p>
<p>    Group net interest income		 358    up 0.8 pct</p>
<p>    Group net commission income	     246    up 14.4 pct</p>
<p>    Group administration costs		421    up 5.0 pct</p>
<p>    Group balance sheet total		 79,728 vs 74,144</p>
<p>    Group lending volume			63,900 up 6.6 pct</p>
<p>    Group BIS equity capital ratio	  9.9 pct vs n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German bank is BHF-Bank AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
